      "comment": "Our description: Traupman and Morgan–Owens have no word for cycling gloves. <span lang=\"la\">Chīrothēca</span> is the medieval word for a glove (M-O s.v. glove, mitten); the adjective is made from <span lang=\"la\">birota</span>, as in the bicycle helmet, <span lang=\"la\">galea birotāria</span>."
